EquipmentRequest. {xor}: a HistoryEvent has exactly one target (Account, Resource, EquipmentRequest or RoomBooking) and a StateCorrection exactly one (EquipmentRequest for CO_01 – CO_03, RoomBooking for CO_04); targetType and targetId store it. decidedBy, handedOverBy and returnedBy are staff references to Account. The common columns createdAt and updatedAt (kickoff rule) are not drawn." style="shape=note;size=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="200" width="380" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en1" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;enumeration&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TargetType&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:6px;&quot;&gt;ACCOUNT&lt;br&gt;RESOURCE&lt;br&gt;EQUIPMENT_REQUEST&lt;br&gt;ROOM_BOOKING&lt;/p&gt;" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;strokeColor=#111827;fillColor=#f8fafc;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="556" width="170" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en2" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;enumeration&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Role&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:6px;&quot;&gt;BORROWER&lt;br&gt;RESOURCE_MANAGER&lt;br&gt;ADMIN&lt;/p&gt;" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;strokeColor=#111827;fillColor=#f8fafc;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1715" y="50" width="195" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en3" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&a